      },
      "text": "Interpretation: cₙ is the amplitude and phase of the nth harmonic.\n|cₙ| = magnitude spectrum (one-sided: multiply by 2 for n>0)\n∠cₙ = phase spectrum\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-FOURIER-ANALYSIS.md#016",
      "path": [
        "01-FOURIER-ANALYSIS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
