        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fourier Analysis - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Convergence**: Dirichlet conditions (finite discontinuities, finite variation) → pointwise\nconvergence except at discontinuities where it converges to midpoint. Gibbs phenomenon:\n~9% overshoot at jump discontinuities, independent of N."
    },
