        "root_concepts": "[fourier, analysis]",
        "section": "signal-processing",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Fourier Analysis - A Layered Guide",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Time domain x(t) | Frequency domain X(jω) | Notes |\n|------------------|------------------------|-------|\n| δ(t) | 1 | Impulse → flat spectrum |\n| 1 | 2πδ(ω) | DC → impulse at DC |\n| e^{-at}u(t), a>0 | 1/(a+jω) | Exponential decay → Lorentzian |\n| rect(t/T) | T·sinc(ωT/2π) | Rectangular pulse → sinc |\n| sinc(t) | π·rect(ω/(2π)) | Sinc → rectangular |\n| e^{jω₀t} | 2πδ(ω-ω₀) | Sinusoid → spectral line |\n| Gaussian e^{-t²} | √π·e^{-ω²/4} | Gaussian ↔ Gaussian |"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-FOURIER-ANALYSIS.md#028",
      "path": [
        "01-FOURIER-ANALYSIS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:signal-processing:01-fourier-analysis, git-history:signal-processing:01-fourier-analysis]",
        "canonical_path": "signal-processing/01-FOURIER-ANALYSIS.md",
        "concepts": "[fourier, analysis]",
        "current_path": "signal-processing/01-FOURIER-ANALYSIS.md",
        "id": "maxim:signal-processing:fourier-analysis",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "signal-processing",
        "remap_from": "[]",
